Ported work
-----------

Orchestrate mode in apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/orchestrate.rs is a port of
GVS5H (https://github.com/slee-persis/GVS5H), Copyright (c) 2026 Persis
Capital Inc., licensed under the MIT License. The full text is in
apps/desktop/licenses/GVS5H-MIT.txt and on the app's Licenses page.

The image generation path in Cerebro Engine (crates/cerebro-engine/src/
diffusion.rs) follows algorithms and layouts from Hugging Face diffusers
(https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers), Copyright the diffusers authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full Apache text is in
LICENSE and on the app's Licenses page.

Cerebro Engine (crates/cerebro-engine/src/vision.rs, gguf.rs and the model
loading kernels) follows tensor layouts, GGUF file formats and kernel
arrangements from llama.cpp and ggml (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp),
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, licensed under the MIT License. The
full text is in apps/desktop/licenses/ggml-MIT.txt and on the app's Licenses
page. Cerebro does not include or run the llama.cpp program.

Third-party packages
--------------------

The app's Licenses page lists every JavaScript package in the built interface
and every Rust crate compiled into the desktop program, with the licence texts
each publishes. That list is generated from the build, not kept by hand.
